   "speaker": "Tony Zappia",
   "party": "Labor",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2017-10-25",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "Labor supported the Therapeutic Goods Amendment (2017 Measures No. 1) Bill and related bill, which implement reforms from the 2015 expert panel review, including provisional registration of new medicines, a new pathway for complementary medicines, and stronger postmarket monitoring. The speaker also cautioned about outsourcing TGA responsibilities and pledged to monitor the changes."
  }
